  "differentiated_finite_integral_bound": "Both energy and pressure satisfy integral abs(exact/reference derivative difference)<=40K/m and reference-tail derivative integral<=D1/(72m\u00b2), D1=100000000. The resulting continuous all-momentum derivative envelope justifies a C1 finite subtracted integral on I, including one-sided endpoint derivatives.",
